**Spectral metrics**:
- Heavy-tail: fit log-log power law σ_i ∝ i^{-α} to sorted singular values (excluding σ_1 or robust tail), MLE for α, test α < 2 (heavy-tailed in the strict sense); also compare to exponential decay (light-tailed) via KS / QQ plot against Pareto and exponential; tail index via Hill estimator; compare to a null (e.g., random Gaussian perturbation of same norm).
